<title>USA: BrandyWine reverse split to be effective.</title>
<headline>BrandyWine reverse split to be effective.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTOWN SQUARE, Pa. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>BrandyWine Realty Trust said Monday that its one-for-three reverse share split will become effective at the close of trading today.</p>
<p>Shares of the real estate investment trust were unchanged Monday afternoon at 5-7/8.</p>
</text>
